-- words --
A fixed store with a Goal in each state: `hyp status --all` prints the same state of each Goal as on H0.
-- run --
hyp status --all
-- floor: contains --
G-ONE  written
-- floor: contains --
G-TWO  open
-- floor: contains --
G-THREE  selected
-- floor: contains --
G-FOUR  ended
-- floor: contains --
G-FIVE  ended
-- floor: contains --
landed: by owner
-- floor: contains --
closed: by owner
-- floor: contains --
run exit: 0
